<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DT Industries raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DT Industries raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley analyst John Mackin said he upgraded DT Industries Inc to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Said stock has been weak and company fundamentals remain strong.</p>
<p>-- Raised earnings per share estimate on fiscal year ending June 1997 to $2.40 from $2.35.  Has fiscal year 1998 estimate of $2.85.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 7/8 at 25.</p>
</text>
